<title>USA: Five largest weekly prices gains in the DJIA.</title>
<headline>Five largest weekly prices gains in the DJIA.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the biggest weekly point gains by the Dow Jones industrial average, according to the New York Stock Exchange:</p>
<p>    Week ending	   point gain</p>
<p>    May 2, 1997	   332.33</p>
<p>    April 18, 1997	311.86</p>
<p>    Aug. 2, 1996	  206.77</p>
<p>    Nov. 8, 1996	  197.79</p>
<p>    Dec. 20, 1996	 179.53</p>
